  "description": "College student Yeonwu can’t stand Ohn, a campus senior wrapped in dark rumors...but fate keeps forcing them together. When Yeonwu rescues a vulnerable, intoxicated Ohn from a dangerous situation, their dynamic shifts overnight. Intrigued by the only guy who treats him with icy disdain, Ohn launches a relentless, seductive charm offensive. Yeon-Wu tries to resist, but Ohn’s intoxicating flirting soon has his heart racing. Can Yeon-Wu guard his heart, or will has love struck far too fast? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
